{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">飲食節目《美食新聞報道》帶領觀眾穿梭港九各地，由多位主持走訪三間風格截然不同的美食熱點。從充滿港式情懷的尖沙咀大牌檔風味小炒，到中環極具歐洲風情的傳統比利時菜，再到西營盤小巷高CP值的手工貝果，為大家呈獻一場豐富的視覺與味覺盛宴！</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第一站由蕭欣浩博士帶領行仔來到尖沙咀棉登徑，造訪一間充滿港式情懷的大牌檔風味餐廳，細嚐多款極具鑊氣的經典小炒與海鮮佳餚：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b6e9f2a3-7043-42c1-804a-e335fb9abf08.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026p8LNgoSp3K1790909858.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b6e9f2a3-7043-42c1-804a-e335fb9abf08.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5bca475c-2dc6-4cec-8b7d-903c4da1b60d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026mxE8X7O2bA1790909858.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5bca475c-2dc6-4cec-8b7d-903c4da1b60d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"dcf3e3ae-32c0-4cf1-93a9-7d43c9d52347.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026pTWm64aIFj1790909858.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"dcf3e3ae-32c0-4cf1-93a9-7d43c9d52347.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃嘉雯與葉靖儀則來到中環，探索一間極具歐洲風情的比利時傳統餐廳，絕對是朋友聚餐的好去處：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7a7af24b-4937-45b2-b5fd-5a0a1bb489b2.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20264QiCJn8Ml21790909861.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7a7af24b-4937-45b2-b5fd-5a0a1bb489b2.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"57f6c86c-b7d8-480a-82ef-cc011b154c73.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026EUEc87Z11O1790909861.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"57f6c86c-b7d8-480a-82ef-cc011b154c73.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c459bd3a-85f2-4118-94b7-254ec52d0614.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026DVCzKL7DoH1790909860.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c459bd3a-85f2-4118-94b7-254ec52d0614.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">最後，林映暉與波波（黃婧靈）前往位於西營盤小巷的一間人氣Bagel小店，試食主打自家製餡料與高CP值的手工貝果：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"546749cd-402d-433a-9f5d-8f0206179f2c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026uVaznrqObO1790909860.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"546749cd-402d-433a-9f5d-8f0206179f2c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7b2e8676-f429-4e4b-86a7-55db21a30d94.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026gWxLGOcynO1790909859.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7b2e8676-f429-4e4b-86a7-55db21a30d94.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T15:19:00.373394+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":278,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}